        "repeaterSections": [
          {
            "heading": "Storage",
            "column": "<p>Have your specialist car stored in one of our 92 custom-built glass boxes. At MY GARAGE Storage, we have ensured heating, security against theft, and the option of ongoing servicing and insurance. We are not merely experts in the field — we share your passion and understand the needs of every top-class car. You can therefore rest assured that your investment and most treasured possession is in safe hands at MY GARAGE Storage.</p>\n",
            "selectMedia": "image",
            "vimeo": null,
            "video": null,
            "image": {
              "sourceUrl": "https://mygarage.skaevt.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Gentlemans_Garage_MG_2024-9.jpg"
            },
            "alignment": "right",
            "link": {
              "target": "",
              "title": "Read more",
              "url": "/en/storage"
            }
          },
          {
            "heading": "Meetings & events",
            "column": "<p>Our exclusive meeting rooms are located in the central showroom, where glass walls offer unobstructed views of the beautiful specialist cars surrounding you. All rooms are luxuriously furnished with designer furniture and fully equipped with large screens and wi-fi. We also create the perfect setting for — and tailor — your next event for up to 300 guests.</p>\n",
            "selectMedia": "image",
            "vimeo": null,
            "video": null,
            "image": {
              "sourceUrl": "https://mygarage.skaevt.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Meeting_Garage_MG_2024-8-e1732700312672.jpg"
            },
            "alignment": "left",
            "link": {
              "target": "",
              "title": "Read more",
              "url": "/en/meetings-events/"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
